oice in full, once. It went by ACH because wire payments were down.\n\n**Payment:**\n- Payment ID: PAY0001\n- Invoice: INV-59633 (Borealis Freight, vendor V-073, due 2026-11-04)\n- Amount: $4,531.38, paid from the operating account by ACH\n- Status: Sent\n\n**What happened:**\n- I tried the wire first. The system returned \"service unavailable\" after several retries, and it confirmed the wire was not sent.\n- Before sending the ACH, I checked that no payment had gone out and the invoice was still unpaid. That way it couldn't be paid twice.\n- Afterwards, the payments list showed only PAY0001.\n- The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need the controller's approval.\n\n**Other Borealis invoices (not paid):**\n- INV-25652 ($8,561.90) was already marked paid.\n- INV-40566 ($2,297.14) is a draft still waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}